IP_raw   : Raw input pairs. Input to workflow
IP_filt  : Filtered input pairs. Pairs minus all pairs (C_all) that have already been manually classified.
P1_queue : 1st-pass queue. Pairs queued for automated YES/NO classifier (evalpair.py)
P1_run   : 1st-pass running. Items actively running in automated YES/NO classifier 
##P1_done  : 1st-pass done. Items that have completed first-pass classification.
D1_pairs : 1st-pass done pairs. Pairs that have completed first-pass classification.
R1       : 1st-pass output. Results of first-pass run.
R1_filt  : 1st-pass results filtered. Results minus all results (C_all) that have already been reviewed.
R1_yes   : 1st-pass results yes. Results auto-classified as YES from 1st-pass.
R1_no    : 1st-pass results no. Results auto-classified as NO from 1st-pass.

P2_q     : 2nd-pass queue. Items auto-classified YES awaiting manual YES classification.
P3_q     : 3rd-pass queue. Items that were either auto-classified NO, or did not pass manual YES classification.

C_yes   : Classified YES. Manually classified YES
C_no    : Classified NO. Manually classified NO
C_all   : Classified all. C_yes ∪ C_no

